# Optional. The server address is normally typed in the app on the sign-in screen and saved on the device,
# so you can change it any time (sign out, edit "Server address", sign in).
# This value only pre-fills that box. Leave it empty if you prefer.
# Examples:
#   Phone / tablet on the shop Wi-Fi:  http://192.168.1.10:4000
#   Android emulator -> this PC:       http://10.0.2.2:4000
#   Browser on this PC:                http://localhost:4000
#   Live site:                         https://your-domain
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
